flowchart TD
  accTitle: One thread. Many contributors. One outcome.
  accDescr: Proposed experience: one outcome can combine code, research, diagrams, and documents. Simple requests can skip decomposition. Dashed bidirectional links are addressed peer messages. Independent tasks join into an evidence-bearing result. Completion, acceptance, delivery, and settlement are separate; settlement is reversible.
  intent --> thread
  thread --> plan
  plan --> a
  plan --> b
  plan --> c
  a --> join
  b --> join
  c --> join
  join --> review
  review --> settle
  a <--> b
  linkStyle 10 stroke-dasharray:5 4
  b <--> c
  linkStyle 11 stroke-dasharray:5 4
  intent["Describe an outcome"]
  thread["Ordinary outcome thread"]
  plan["Visible plan + dependencies"]
  a["Task A / agent"]
  b["Task B / agent"]
  c["Task C / agent"]
  join["Reconcile + verify results"]
  review["Review outcome / decide"]
  settle["Settle or continue"]
